| Successor only | Place before successor when predecessor is absent |
| No anchor | Deterministic boundary placement with neither anchor |
| Missing-nearest/fallback | Ignore missing nearest and select valid fallback |
| Same-boundary tie | Stable deterministic tie order |
| Reordered anchors | Reject atomically when predecessor follows successor |
